      },
      "text": "林子里没有舞台,风一经过,树影就开始合奏。",
      "text_en": "There is no stage in the grove; when wind passes, the tree shadows begin to play together.",
      "dialogue": [
        "林子里没有舞台，风一经过，树影就开始合奏。",
        "你坐下来，它们就停了下来——等你的节拍。",
        "她把这片林子当成练习曲的地方。风停的时候，她也不出声。"
      ],
      "dialogue_en": [
        "There is no stage in the grove; when wind passes, the tree shadows begin to play together.",
        "You sit down and they pause — waiting for your beat.",
        "She used this grove for practice. When the wind stopped, she went quiet as well."
      ],
      "model_idx": 2
